            "tab": "enso",
            "question": "Can I use dark leaf tobacco in ENSŌ?",
            "answer": "<p>Yes, ENSŌ is designed for every tobacco and herbal molasses. For dark leafs we recommend to give it more heating time after pre-heat and use smaller leafs.</p>"
