            "question": "How much should I load and how should I pack it ENSŌ?",
            "answer": "<p>Place 8–15g in the ceramic cup, semi-dense with a central airway. Start at 175 °C for 5–8 min, then step up 30–45° as needed.<br/><a href=\"https://youtu.be/4FlQ9ACwn00?si=58nw5sS5eecGmuC1\" target=\"_blank\">(Watch ▶ Mastering ENSŌ)</a></p>"
